# Project Rules and Guidelines

## Package Management
- Use `uv` instead of `pip` for package management
- Example: `uv pip install <package>` instead of `pip install <package>`
- Example: `uv pip show <package>` instead of `pip show <package>`

## Development Workflow
- Always use the virtual environment located at `.venv`
- Activate the environment with `source .venv/bin/activate` before running commands 